🔧 Quick Fix Code Changes

Fix 1: Add Leaflet Fallback

```javascript
// Add this before your app initialization
function ensureLeaflet() {
    if (typeof L === 'undefined') {
        console.warn('Leaflet not loaded, loading fallback...');
        const script = document.createElement('script');
        script.src = 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js';
        script.onload = () => location.reload();
        document.head.appendChild(script);
        return false;
    }
    return true;
}
```

Fix 2: Wrap Map Initialization in Try-Catch

```javascript
initMap: function() {
    try {
        console.log('Initializing map...');
        // ... existing map code ...
    } catch (error) {
        console.error('Map initialization failed:', error);
        const mapContainer = document.getElementById('map');
        if (mapContainer) {
            mapContainer.innerHTML = `
                <div class="alert alert-danger">
                    <strong>Map Error:</strong> ${error.message}<br>
                    <button onclick="location.reload()" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary mt-2">
                        Reload Page
                    </button>
                </div>
            `;
        }
    }
}
```

